.venv*/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Datasets: never commit teaching data. Every download target and source URL is
# documented in docs/datasets.md and english/docs/datasets.md instead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/data/**
!**/data/README.md
!**/data/README.zh-CN.md
datasets/
**/*.parquet
**/*.cache
**/labels.cache

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated experiment products: weights, plots, run folders, notebooks exports
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/outputs/**
!**/outputs/README.md
!**/outputs/**/
!**/outputs/**/README.md
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.torchscript
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# Ultralytics recreates its local config and font on first run.
english/Ultralytics/

